## ✨ 01. PROJECT OVERVIEW

The **Personal Portfolio Website** is a frontend development project created as part of the **Oasis Infobyte Web Development & Designing Internship — Level 1, Task 2**.

This project presents my professional identity through a modern, visually engaging, and responsive digital portfolio.

The website introduces **Muhammad Yaseen**, professionally known as **Yaseen Baloch** — a Computer Science undergraduate and aspiring Software Engineer interested in programming, modern web development, AI automation, and technology entrepreneurship.

The design combines a premium dark interface, purple accents, contemporary typography, elegant content cards, and responsive layouts.

> **Design Philosophy:** Learn continuously. Build meaningfully. Innovate confidently.

